    "title": "Easter 2026; Is Costco open today? What about Walmart, Shoprite, more",
    "text": "April 5, 2026, 2:55 a.m. ETWondering what's open on Easter Sunday, April 5, 2026? If you're searching for which grocery stores, pharmacies, big-box retailers, and restaurants are open today, you're in the right place.Many major stores are operating on reduced holiday hours, or are closed today, so read on to see the latest guide on what stores are open and closed near you right now.What grocery stores are open today for Easter Sunday 2026?Need a last‑minute grocery run on Easter Sunday 2026? Here are the grocery stores open today, April 5:Shoprite (open 6 a.m. to 8 p.m., but hours vary widely by location)Acme (most open, closing as early at 6 p.m. check your local store)Walmart (open 6 a.m. to 11 p.m.; check local store hours)Wegmans (open regular hours)Whole Foods (most open, closing early at 6 p.m. ET; check your local store)Trader Joe's (open regular hours on Easter)BJ's Wholesale Club (most are open 8 a.m. to 6 p.m. ET; check local hours)Weis Markets (open, most closing at 5 p.m.; check your local store)Stop & Shop (open, typically from 7 a.m. to 5 p.m.; check your local store)Foodtown (varies by store)Lidl (open regular hours)CVS (open 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.; check local hours)Walgreens (open 7 a.m. to 10 p.m.; check local hours)Dollar General / Family Dollar (open 8 a.m. to 10 p.m.; check local hours)What retail stores are open today for Easter Sunday 2026?Home Depot (open 8 a.m. to 6 p.m.; check local store hours)Walmart (open 6 a.m. to 11 p.m.; check local store hours)CVS (open 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.; check local store hours)Walgreens (open 7 a.m. to 10 p.m.; check local store hours)Old Navy (open 10 a.m. to 7 p.m.; check local store hours)Tractor Supply (open 9 a.m. to 7 p.m.; check local store hours)Family Dollar (open 8 a.m. to 10 p.m.; check local store hours)Dollar General (open 8 a.m. to 10 p.m.; check local hours)PetSmart (open 10 a.m. to 7 p.m.; check local store hours)Cabela's/Bass Pro Shops (open 10 a.m. to 7 p.m.; check local store hours)What restaurants are open today for Easter Sunday 2026?Several restaurants, fast‑food chains, drive‑thrus, convenience stores, and coffee shops are open today for Easter Sunday:Starbucks (open, hours vary by location)Dunkin' (open, hours vary by location; check local hours)McDonald's (open, hours vary by location; check local hours)Chili's (11 a.m. to 11 p.m. for most; hours vary by location)The Cheesecake Factory (open lunch and dinner; hours vary by location)Olive Garden (open lunch and dinner; hours vary by location)Wendy's (hours vary by location; check local hours)Applebee's (hours vary by location; check local hours)Burger King (hours vary by location; check local hours)Taco Bell (hours vary by location; check local hours)Panera Bread (hours vary by location; check local hours)Popeyes (hours vary by location; check local hours)Subway (hours vary by location; check local hours)Jersey Mike's (hours vary by location; check local hours)Friendly's (hours vary by location; check local hours)IHOP (open 24/7, or standard Sunday hours)KFC (hours vary by location; check local hours)White Castle (hours vary by location, some open 24-hours)Red Lobster (hours vary by location; check local hours)Wawa (open 24/7; check local hours)QuickChek (open 24/7; check local hours)7-Eleven (open 24/7; check local hours)What grocery stores are closed today on Easter Sunday 2026?Grocery stores closed on Easter Sunday 2026:CostcoTargetSam's ClubAldi Dollar TreeWhat stores are closed today on Easter Sunday 2026?Stores closed on Easter Sunday 2026:Costco (open on Monday, April 6)Target (open Monday, April 6)Sam's Club (open on Monday, April 6)Aldi (open on Monday, April 6)Lowe's (open on Monday, April 6)Kohl's (open on Monday, April 6)Best Buy (open on Monday, April 6)Five Below (open on Monday, April 6)Burlington (open on Monday, April 6)Dollar Tree (open on Monday, April 6)Ulta (open on Monday, April 6)Sephora (open on Monday, April 6)TJ Maxx, Marshalls, and HomeGoods (open on Monday, April 6)Petco (open on Monday, April 6)Aldi (open on Monday, April 6)Michaels (open on Monday, April 6)Sam's Club (open on Monday, April 6)Macy's (open on Monday, April 6)Hobby Lobby (open on Monday, April 6)Dick's Sporting Goods (open on Monday, April 6)Macy's (open on Monday, April 6)Nordstrom/Nordstrom Rack (open on Monday, April 6)What restaurants are closed today on Easter Sunday 2026?Chipotle is closed today for Easter Sunday 2026, and Chick‑fil‑A is also closed on Sunday, April 5 — as it is every Sunday.Lori Comstock is a New Jersey-based news reporter covering trending news with USA TODAY Network's Mid-Atlantic Connect Team. She covers news in the Northeast, including New Jersey, Pennsylvania, Delaware, Washington DC, Maryland, and Virginia. Reach her at LComstock@usatodayco.com.",
